{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6fd9aa9dc5a833d9b87","chatId":"0c38220afa09429ea4bcf84e0f0fbff8","sessionId":null,"userId":99415,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":9466,"promptTokens":423,"completionTokens":210,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590873283443667,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6fd9aa9dc5a833d9b85","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483965851,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6fd9aa9dc5a833d9b85","chatId":"0c38220afa09429ea4bcf84e0f0fbff8","sessionId":null,"userId":99415,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n比尔正在向他的中国朋友萧学习如何使用筷子。经过几次尝试，比尔终于成功地用筷子夹起了一把饭，吃完饭后，他将筷子直立放在饭碗里。萧立刻取出筷子，放在筷子架上。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，比尔最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 钦佩\nB) 反对\nC) 气恼\nD) 悔恨\nE) 惊喜\nF) 激动\n\n## 问题 2\n比尔为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 在几次失败之后，他终于成功地使用了筷子，这让他很兴奋\nB) 他很激动，因为他终于在很长时间后得以进食\nC) 他认为将筷子直插入饭碗是一种尊重的表现\nD) 他认为肖会对他能够使用筷子而感到骄傲。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590873283443667,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6fd9aa9dc5a833d9b87","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483965848,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:46:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"b30369121828486eb7395fd2747821f8"}